<title>USA: SCOR says floods won't affect fy 97 results.</title>
<headline>SCOR says floods won't affect fy 97 results.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>SCOR, a French insurance company, said Thursday that serious flooding in central Europe will not create a damaging impact on company results in fiscal 1997.</p>
<p>SCOR said in a statement that the expected net losses of $10-12 million because of the flooding, are part of the normal course of business.</p>
</text>
